cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this geospatial dataset in academic research or technical reporting, please cite it as below."
title: "Bouhedma National Park Geospatial & Biodiversity Monitoring Database"
abstract: "Comprehensive geospatial, ecological, and biodiversity database collected during the WWF Talent Academy 2026 field camp in Bouhedma National Park (Tunisia), covering 24 layers of pre-Saharan Vachellia tortilis savanna monitoring, large herbivore censuses, carnivore camera-trapping, mist netting, and phytoecology."
